{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c6 Synopsis \u25c6</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Does every romance have to end in marriage or breakup?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Is a life without marriage or children the key to true happiness?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether or not you've ever been in love,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >you\u2019ve surely heard countless perspectives on romance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, you\u2019ll play as a woman who is in a relationship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When your ex, current partner, and first love each begin to stir your heart,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >how will the tangled threads of love shape your destiny?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into this trial of love</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and uncover the ending that truly belongs to you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c6 Character Introduction \u25c6</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u674e\u627f\u821c ( Ex-Partner )</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365970/extras/4de3a30766fae5d53fe24f3382d857f2.avif?t=1735920764\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365970/extras_big/4de3a30766fae5d53fe24f3382d857f2.avif?t=1735920764 width=800 height=426 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u9ad8\u535a\u4ec1\uff08 First Love \uff09</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365970/extras/61f96d72f2be22cd477e3159fafbf839.avif?t=1735920764\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365970/extras_big/61f96d72f2be22cd477e3159fafbf839.avif?t=1735920764 width=800 height=426 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u66fe\u5b87\u7fd4\uff08 Current Partner )</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365970/extras/870fef7d5294a9b37c537178e0e25a2b.avif?t=1735920764\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365970/extras_big/870fef7d5294a9b37c537178e0e25a2b.avif?t=1735920764 width=800 height=426 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c6 Key Features \u25c6</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choices Affect the Ending: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every decision you make will shape the direction of your story, offering a variety of possible outcomes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique Male Lead Storylines: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each male lead has a unique, heartfelt storyline that keeps you coming back for more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploring the Truths of Love: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A genuine portrayal of the struggles and choices within love, offering resonance and reflection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3365970?t=1735920764","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365970/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1735920764","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365970/701f96a9ef25f64549c1e9b1c352ae5e6c4ced29/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1735920764","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365970/701f96a9ef25f64549c1e9b1c352ae5e6c4ced29/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1735920764","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"The game script includes themes such as drinking, suicide implications, and revealing clothing. Some scenarios can be avoided through player choices, and all sensitive content is designed with a focus on narrative depth an